{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Coal.</b> From ימטר על רשעים פחים ופחים (He will rain snares upon the wicked [Psalms 11:6]) — פחים on the pattern of אחים, and this verse is the opposite of the first." "<b>To kindle.</b> From על תתחר (do not vie), and it is אל תתערב (do not mix in [Proverbs 26:17])."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:55.509355514Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}